Z||000002||spideyfoot||05-13-2001||10:12 AM||||sorry it was red. They came up with that BS price off the top of their head because I have long hair and look like I have no money. I was considering it for the seats. If I would have driven my Porsche and not had my work shirt on they would have at least come out and help me. This same lot has about a $3000 944 in rough shape for $7000. They are right down the street from the auto auction I bet they have $300 at most in that Fiero. It just hammers in the fact to never buy a car from the lot. That was a copy of the email I sent to my TN Fieros group. I thought you guys would get a kick out of it. If it was posted on the forum it would be flamed crispy black. <p>[This message has been edited by spideyfoot (edited 05-13-2001).]||||reg||1
